EliGSiR publication license index
=================================

This file is an index only. It is not a blanket license and does not apply uniformly to every file in this source export.

* Files classified as `eligsir-original` (EliGSiR-original) in
  [`docs/PROVENANCE_MATRIX.md`](docs/PROVENANCE_MATRIX.md) are available under
  the Apache License, Version 2.0. The complete text is in
  [`LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`](LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt).
* Files classified as `graphdeco-derived` (GraphDeco-derived) retain the upstream
  Inria/MPII/GRAPHDECO Gaussian-Splatting research/evaluation and
  non-commercial terms. The complete text is in
  [`LICENSES/GraphDeco-Gaussian-Splatting.txt`](LICENSES/GraphDeco-Gaussian-Splatting.txt)
  and remains available as [`LICENSE.md`](LICENSE.md) for upstream headers.
* Third-party components retain their own upstream terms and notices. Their
  provenance, scope, and unresolved release blockers are recorded in
  [`docs/THIRD_PARTY_PROVENANCE.yaml`](docs/THIRD_PARTY_PROVENANCE.yaml) and
  [`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

Read the file-level provenance record and applicable notices before using or
redistributing any component of this export.
